    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to the Archmage's Sanctum, a hidden subterranean chamber where ancient magic and intricate logic intricately intertwine. The legendary Archmage has sealed his most prized and powerful possession within the ultimate enchanted vessel, known throughout the realm as the Dragon Reliquary. To obtain what lies hidden inside, you must decipher cryptic ancient scripts, channel raw arcane power, and prove your undeniable worth to the various enchanted mechanisms scattered throughout the shadowy room. The air here crackles with residual energy, but time is rapidly running out. The sanctum's protective wards have begun to collapse, and soon the chamber will be sealed forever beneath the earth. Will you be able to unravel the deep mysteries, master the spellcraft required, and claim the ultimate prize before the final collapse? Your journey begins now in this room of wonders.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
